              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakho oyiholayo phakathi kwawo wonke amadodana awazalayo; futhi akukho noyedwa owambamba ngesandla kuwo wonke amadodana awakhulisile.",
          "type": "text",
