              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isho kanje iNkosi yakho uJehova, noNkulunkulu wakho omela indaba yabantu bakhe, ithi: Bheka, ngiyithathile esandleni sakho indebe yokuthuthumela, inkezo yenkezo yolaka lwami; ungase ungabe usaliphuza.",
          "type": "text",
